    "body": "Bumps [nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release](https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release) from 7 to 9.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/releases\">nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v9.0.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v8.0.0...v9.0.0\">9.0.0</a> (2026-10-16)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use Lux instead of LuaRocks (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1015\">#1015</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use Lux instead of LuaRocks (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1015\">#1015</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/fcb81163b652a5d5f88e1f74645a2295a492a2fb\">fcb8116</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v8.0.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.3.0...v8.0.0\">8.0.0</a> (2026-10-14)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use Lua 5.5 runtime (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1009\">#1009</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use Lua 5.5 runtime (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1009\">#1009</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/413b4c8c9ca35d311ab37842b935d1617eb3b979\">413b4c8</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.3.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.2.0...v7.3.0\">7.3.0</a> (2026-09-23)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>support using scm rockspecs as templates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/991\">#991</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/d445df9cbce7f502c4fb30a41c18592d0ac96c4c\">d445df9</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.2.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.1.0...v7.2.0\">7.2.0</a> (2025-04-13)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>neovim:</strong> support <code>lsp</code> runtime directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/643\">#643</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/commit/da4e090accd58917793aa7116c825d7ea7590754\">da4e090</a>)</li>\n<li>set up luarocks path before test install (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/597\">#597</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/commit/7bc0a20c425da1ba577a4ff6b2c56c81e2feb4ca\">7bc0a20</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.1.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.0.1...v7.1.0\">7.1.0</a> (2024-06-21)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add build backends to release action (<a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/commit/41f04b5bb45e34a8cc871ea49bb3cca07c7d3da1\">41f04b5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.0.1</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.1.0...v7.2.0\">7.2.0</a> (2026-05-17)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>neovim:</strong> support <code>lsp</code> runtime directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/643\">#643</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/da4e090accd58917793aa7116c825d7ea7590754\">da4e090</a>)</li>\n<li>set up luarocks path before test install (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/597\">#597</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/7bc0a20c425da1ba577a4ff6b2c56c81e2feb4ca\">7bc0a20</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v7.0.0...v7.1.0\">7.1.0</a> (2026-05-16)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add build backends to release action (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/41f04b5bb45e34a8cc871ea49bb3cca07c7d3da1\">41f04b5</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>neovim:</strong> support <code>lsp</code> runtime directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/643\">#643</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/da4e090accd58917793aa7116c825d7ea7590754\">da4e090</a>)</li>\n<li>set up luarocks path before test install (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/597\">#597</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/7bc0a20c425da1ba577a4ff6b2c56c81e2feb4ca\">7bc0a20</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>remove luarocks build backends (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/440\">#440</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/78dd24621e61cc569bd028349313fe4ece2ab953\">78dd246</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v6.0.0...v7.0.0\">7.0.0</a> (2026-05-15)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>drop support for running tests in favour of nvim-busted-action (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/437\">#437</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add build backends to release action (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/41f04b5bb45e34a8cc871ea49bb3cca07c7d3da1\">41f04b5</a>)</li>\n<li>drop support for running tests in favour of nvim-busted-action (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/437\">#437</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/2af6c3a00772ee42a161d02a8d324ab53b24bb13\">2af6c3a</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>neovim:</strong> support <code>lsp</code> runtime directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/643\">#643</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/da4e090accd58917793aa7116c825d7ea7590754\">da4e090</a>)</li>\n<li>set up luarocks path before test install (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/597\">#597</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/7bc0a20c425da1ba577a4ff6b2c56c81e2feb4ca\">7bc0a20</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>remove luarocks build backends (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/440\">#440</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/78dd24621e61cc569bd028349313fe4ece2ab953\">78dd246</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/compare/v5.0.0...v6.0.0\">6.0.0</a> (2026-05-14)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>drop support for running tests in favour of nvim-busted-action (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/issues/437\">#437</a>)</li>\n<li>deprecate <code>test_interpreters</code> and disable tests by default</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/b053e4493d8cd5780e31f90e246958276121151f\"><code>b053e44</code></a> chore(main): release 9.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1016\">#1016</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/fcb81163b652a5d5f88e1f74645a2295a492a2fb\"><code>fcb8116</code></a> feat!: use Lux instead of LuaRocks (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1015\">#1015</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/b269146602489cd981a911e97ef34b8d937e8427\"><code>b269146</code></a> deps: update flake.lock (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1014\">#1014</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/0a2c5271f4d91828d4d7b7b94ce8ef095169ec7b\"><code>0a2c527</code></a> deps: update flake.lock (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1012\">#1012</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/c13929713eb357b685d5616909a8887cddfc1d7c\"><code>c139297</code></a> deps: update flake.lock (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1011\">#1011</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/2158fb00d5dc0e9cdbcde5f318719ff0f3b5c2df\"><code>2158fb0</code></a> chore(main): release 8.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1010\">#1010</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/413b4c8c9ca35d311ab37842b935d1617eb3b979\"><code>413b4c8</code></a> feat!: use Lua 5.5 runtime (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1009\">#1009</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/8cf17b3bfbb05c53b3eda9a2e7ea81c8b03b3741\"><code>8cf17b3</code></a> deps: update flake.lock (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1007\">#1007</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/9b6aaccda399b7f3362011bf3b8f8896f71cc185\"><code>9b6aacc</code></a> deps: update flake.lock (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nvim-neorocks/luarocks-tag-release/issues/1006\">#1006</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lumen-oss/luarocks-tag-release/commit/8ece25b6d